    "text": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!-- Two squares with a square hole, each one path of two subpaths, no stroke.\n     Left: even-odd, hole winds the same way. Right: nonzero, hole winds the other way. -->\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100mm\" height=\"50mm\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 50\">\n  <path id=\"evenodd\" fill=\"#ff0000\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"none\"\n        d=\"M10,10 H40 V40 H10 Z M20,20 H30 V30 H20 Z\"/>\n  <path id=\"nonzero\" style=\"fill:#ff0000;fill-rule:nonzero\" stroke=\"none\"\n        d=\"M60,10 H90 V40 H60 Z M70,20 V30 H80 V20 Z\"/>\n  <path id=\"stroked\" fill=\"#00e000\" stroke=\"#0000ff\" d=\"M10,45 H90\"/>\n</svg>\n",
